  "reasoning": "The defendants (the company and its legal representative) used a government office's name to issue a recommendation letter, enabling an unqualified company to illegally extract oil, and paid a public official 200,000 RMB as an improper reward. This constitutes the act of a unit giving a bribe to a state functionary, which matches the crime of unit bribery (单位行贿). No other listed offenses apply to the described conduct.",
  "final_answer": "单位行贿"
